  message: "Fixed + merged to dev (fast-forward 83b23f8345, commit 394cbcd88d). Both axis_conformance leaks closed: (1) elixir _handle_dot_call's default evidence_type 'module_qualified_call' (unregistered, ~512 edges) now emits the registered generic 'ast_call' (0 consumers of the old value); (2) all_known_pass_ids() now unions each registered linker's EMITTED PASS_ID via pass_metadata._resolve_linker_pass_id, so the view_template family's divergent 'view-template-linker' (registration name view_template/_phoenix/... but shared _view_template_core.PASS_ID) is cataloged -- correct-by-construction for any future divergence, a no-op for non-divergent linkers (make_pass_id is identity). BEHAVIORAL EVIDENCE (full run on Phoenix repo, both violation classes present): axis_conformance 515 -> 0 (module_qualified_call x512 + view-template-linker eliminated). Core + common 100% coverage (updated test_elixir.py resolver-fallback assertion + new test_catalog.py emitted-pass-id test)."  # d704
